 "item": {
  "title": "Millcreek buildings",
  "type": "Web Map",
  "snippet": "County building footprints coloured by lidar roof height, over the hillshade. Unvalidated LiDAR planning estimates from the 2023 Salt Lake Valley QL1 lidar (flown October-November 2023); not surveyed or field-verified data.",
  "description": "<p><b>Unvalidated LiDAR planning estimates from the 2023 Salt Lake Valley QL1 lidar (flown October-November 2023); not surveyed or field-verified data.</b></p><p>22,042 county footprints coloured by median roof height above the ground (October 22 consensus roofs); grey where the lidar saw no roof. Click a building for its median and 95th percentile heights in metres and feet, the share of the footprint with lidar roof points, and any flags in plain words. Buildings draw from 1:150,000 inward.</p><p>Datum: NAD83(2011) taken to WGS84 / Web Mercator with WGS_1984_(ITRF08)_To_NAD_1983_2011, the same for every layer. Records: canopy-toolbox/reviews/2026-10-23/agol-styling in buschbrian/agol-python-scripts.</p>",
  "tags": [
